        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Southern Africa, Zimbabwe, Zambia, Ingombe Ilede\n- People: Cecil Rhodes\n- Topics: British protectorates, country formation, borders\n\nFacts:\n- Cecil Rhodes founded a British protectorate in a southern Africa territory.\n- The former British protectorate later became two countries, Zimbabwe and Zambia.\n- The river near Ingombe Ilede forms the boundary, with Zimbabwe to the south and Zambia to the north of the river.",
